misleading","summary":"英国 AI Security Institute 发布论文，测试合成攻击生成方式对监视器评估的影响。评估一个 OpenAI 前生产监视器时，同一监视器对不同攻击策略的漏报率从 0.2%（基础提示）到 23%（转录编辑）不等，优化程度也会显著改变结果。作者指出合成转录只是真实有害行为代理，其代表性难以证明，仅凭监视器评估不足以保证部署安全，需辅以能力限制、人工在环和沙箱等分层防护。","reason":"原文用同一监视器实测出 0.2% 到 23% 的漏报率差异，说明合成攻击策略选择会让监视器评估结果失真。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/tl8v9gto8rd3e4x40xfbljj13","originalUrl":"https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/attack-policy-selection-can-make-monitor-evaluations-misleading","publishedAt":"2026-11-22T23:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-22T23:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-23T18:13:17.834Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1h5nh7k","originalSourceName":"英国 AI Security Institute：Blog（网页）","family":"outlet-h20tt3","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":"paper","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/tl8v9gto8rd3e4x40xfbljj13","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T00:18:33.879Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["原文用同一监视器实测出 0.2% 到 23% 的漏报率差异，说明合成攻击策略选择会让监视器评估结果失真。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1h5nh7k","name":"英国 AI Security Institute：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T00:18:33.879Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cyorgi8t8dm2fo6ee3b5a6qs2","title":"Google Search AI Mode 支持连接 Google Wallet、Drive 和 Gemini 应用","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-11-23T17:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cyorgi8t8dm2fo6ee3b5a6qs2","https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-search-personal-intelligence-apps"],"articles":[{"id":"cyorgi8t8dm2fo6ee3b5a6qs2","title":"Google Search AI Mode 支持连接 Google Wallet、Drive 和 